---
import { href } from '../lib/url';
interface Props { freeFeatures: string[]; creditFeatures: { name: string; desc: string; pricing: string }[]; demo: boolean }
const { freeFeatures, creditFeatures, demo } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="mt-16" aria-labelledby="billing-details-heading"><h2 id="billing-details-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold">了解免费能力与积分规则</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">个人版能力仍在规划与开发中，以下为范围说明；最终能力以正式发行说明为准。</p>
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold">01. 调用前先报价</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">选定内容、用途、模型与预算上限，确认后才发起官方 AI 调用。</p></div><div class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold">02. 预留与实际结算</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">先预留预算，再按已核实用量结算、释放剩余预留。不会自动突破确认的总预算。</p></div><div class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold">03. 积分不锁资料</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">积分用完或会员到期，本机浏览、编辑、检索、备份与导出仍可使用。</p></div></div>
  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="card p-7"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">本地功能 · 免费范围</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">在本机运行，不消耗云端积分：</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">{freeFeatures.map(feature => <li>{feature}</li>)}</ul></div><div class="card p-7"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">官方 AI · 按需使用积分</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">规划中的问答、起草、专题整理与 OCR：</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-4">{creditFeatures.map(feature => <div class="rounded-lg bg-panel-2 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">{feature.name}</h4><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">{feature.desc}</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-primary">{demo ? `${feature.pricing}（内测估算，待正式发布）` : '按正式价格与调用前报价确认，具体规则待发布'}</p></div>)}</div></div></div>
  <div class="card mt-8 p-7"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">内测启动权益</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">注册赠分与新手任务奖励仍待规则核验，本次不执行真实发放。</p><div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-lg bg-panel-2 p-5"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">注册赠送</p><p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">{demo ? '1,000 积分 · 示例' : '规则待发布'}</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-muted">资格、领取条件与有效期以正式活动规则为准。</p></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-panel-2 p-5"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">新手任务奖励</p><p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">{demo ? '900 积分 · 示例' : '规则待发布'}</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-muted">资料整理、本体搭建与问答等探索任务，分阶段核验。</p></div></div></div>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href={href('/personal/')} class="btn btn-secondary">了解个人版</a><a href={href('/personal/how-it-works/')} class="btn btn-secondary">查看工作方式</a><a href={href('/personal/privacy/')} class="btn btn-secondary">查看出网清单</a></div>
</section>
